To resetseen from spot (a whole number).
If spot is more than 31, return.
Set item spot of seen to 0.
Resetseen from spot plus 1.

To clearcells.
If the last position of regioncells is less than 0, return.
remove the last item from regioncells.
Clearcells.

To clearstarts.
If the last position of regionstart is less than 0, return.
remove the last item from regionstart.
Clearstarts.

To clearwalls.
If the last position of regionwalls is less than 0, return.
remove the last item from regionwalls.
Clearwalls.

To clearthreats.
If the last position of threats is less than 0, return.
remove the last item from threats.
