remove the last item from regionthreatstart.
Clearthreatstarts.

To findthreat from spot (a whole number) with finish (a whole number).
If spot is more than finish, return.
If item spot of threats is wantedcell, set threatfound to 1, return.
Findthreat from spot plus 1 with finish.

To exploreempty from cell (a whole number).
The region is currentregion.
Set item region of regionwalls to item region of regionwalls plus 1.
Set wantedcell to cell.
The start is item region of regionthreatstart.
The finish is the last position of threats.
Set threatfound to 0.
Findthreat from start with finish.
If threatfound is 0, Place cell into threats.

To explore from cell (a whole number).
If cell is less than 0, return.
If cell is more than 31, return.
If item cell of seen is 1, return.
If item cell of grid is 2, return.
If item cell of grid is 0, exploreempty from cell, return.
Set item cell of seen to 1.
Place cell into regioncells.
The row is cell divided by 8.
The column is cell modulo 8.
If row is more than 0, explore from cell minus 8.
If row is less than 3, explore from cell plus 8.
If column is more than 0, explore from cell minus 1.
If column is less than 7, explore from cell plus 1.

To scanone from spot (a whole number).
The cellend is the last position of regioncells.
The cellstart is cellend plus 1.
The threatend is the last position of threats.
The threatstart is threatend plus 1.
Place cellstart into regionstart.
Place threatstart into regionthreatstart.
Place 0 into regionwalls.
Set currentregion to the last position of regionwalls.
Explore from spot.

To scan from spot (a whole number).
If spot is more than 31, return.
If item spot of grid is 1 and item spot of seen is 0, scanone from spot.
Scan from spot plus 1.

To choose.
Set bestregion to -1.
Set bestscore to -1.
The lastregion is the last position of regionwalls.
For every region from 0 to lastregion.
The score is item region of regionwalls.
If score is more than bestscore, set bestscore to score, set bestregion to region.

To bounds with region (a whole number).
Set rangestart to item region of regionstart.
Set rangefinish to the last position of regioncells.
If region is less than regioncount minus 1.
The next is region plus 1.
The nextstart is item next of regionstart.
Set rangefinish to nextstart minus 1.

To threatbounds with region (a whole number).
Set threatbegin to item region of regionthreatstart.
Set threatend to the last position of threats.
If region is less than regioncount minus 1.
The next is region plus 1.
The nextstart is item next of regionthreatstart.
Set threatend to nextstart minus 1.

To quarantine from spot (a whole number) with finish (a whole number).
If spot is more than finish, return.
The cell is item spot of regioncells.
Set item cell of grid to 2.
Quarantine from spot plus 1 with finish.

To spreadcells from spot (a whole number) with finish (a whole number).
If spot is more than finish, return.
The cell is item spot of threats.
Set item cell of grid to 1.
Spreadcells from spot plus 1 with finish.

To spread from region (a whole number).
If region is more than the last position of regionwalls, return.
If region is bestregion, spread from region plus 1, return.
Threatbounds with region.
Spreadcells from threatbegin with threatend.
Spread from region plus 1.

To apply.
The chosen is bestregion.
The score is item chosen of regionwalls.
Set totalwalls to totalwalls plus score.
Bounds with chosen.
Quarantine from rangestart with rangefinish.
Spread from 0.

To reset.
Resetseen from 0.
Clearcells.
