Set bestregion to -1.

Set active to 1.
Repeat while active is 1.
Reset.
Scan from 0.
The top is the last position of regionwalls.
Set regioncount to top plus 1.
Choose.
If bestregion is less than 0, set active to 0.
If bestregion is at least 0, Apply.

